      <description>COLUMBUS, Ohio — Ohio’s county sheriffs issued 77,159 concealed handgun licenses and renewals in 2025, according to the state’s annual concealed carry report released Friday by Attorney General Dave Yost. The report shows that sheriffs issued 13,876 new licenses and processed 63,283 renewals during the year. Concealed handgun licenses in Ohio must be renewed every […]</description>
